    vulkan_no_wait_pending_submission_blocks_followup_compute_2026-09-09, 2, "2026-11-12 lane triage (vulkan-mac lane): required fix is in the Rust runtime owner (VulkanState.quarantined_compute gate, destroy_fence handle-only revocation) = src/compiler_rust + src/runtime, outside this lane's file scope. Pure-Simple side re-confirmed non-authoritative (copied integer handles; cannot release native quarantine). Design docs remain the spec for the runtime owner. No change; open."

